{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're just a normal, everyday farm boy. You want to escape the day-to-day drudge of working on your parents farm, but you don't have the means to do so. For now, you pass the time by flirting, and bedding, the local village ladies. That includes your sister's best friend, Isabella. Overall, it's a peaceful existence!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668440/extras/ecc3288e781280fee32cd09499a02dcd.avif?t=1770342310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668440/extras_big/ecc3288e781280fee32cd09499a02dcd.avif?t=1770342310 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>But that isn't going to last long. Alora and Alorine, the two goddess-like sisters who oversee the lands of Euchora, are at odds over the future of the people. Alorine wants to control them, while Alora sees their role as one of a silent benefactor. When Alorine attacks, devastation is left in her wake. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668440/extras/1beb82fd97e8a4229f57e52796817758.avif?t=1770342310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668440/extras_big/1beb82fd97e8a4229f57e52796817758.avif?t=1770342310 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>But something awakens within you. Something you did not know was there, and now Alorine wants it for herself. Can you escape from her evil plans? Where is this all leading? What about those you care about? <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668440/extras/44154a29f15bfb008c3921ebe36ae9b4.avif?t=1770342310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668440/extras_big/44154a29f15bfb008c3921ebe36ae9b4.avif?t=1770342310 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>Darkness and Desire is an Adult Visual Novel where you will guide the narrative to its conclusion. You choose who to interact with. You decide how the interactions will shape the story in an immersive and detailed fantasy world, surrounded by custom music and audio. Experience the story in your own way!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668440?t=1770342310","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668440?t=1770342310","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668440/420a1d0693bde059da20b7b9387c521ca6891fb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770342310","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668440/420a1d0693bde059da20b7b9387c521ca6891fb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770342310","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Darkness and Desire is an adult, erotic, Visual Novel. It contains adult language, alcohol usage, nudity, sexual themes, sexual situations, and strong sexual content. The sexual content is amongst fully consensual adults at all times."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're just a normal, everyday farm boy. You want to escape the day-to-day drudge of working on your parents farm, but you don't have the means to do so. For now, you pass the time by flirting, and bedding, the local village ladies. That includes y